[00:00.000] 作词 : Austin Lunn
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Austin Lunn
[00:44.050]The white cedar
[00:54.108]remembers
[01:02.612]this land before
[01:12.560]my grandfather's Axe.
[01:21.336]Hallowed.
[01:24.617]The lands he once tread.
[01:32.602]Hollowed.
[01:35.847]The grave on his land.
[01:43.773]Haunted.
[01:49.137]The heart in his chest
[01:55.088]Harrowed.
[02:00.334]My memories of him.
[02:51.010]From howling wind to his last breath.
[03:02.276]The fragrant timber falling into thawing moss.
[03:13.631]The wrinkles around his eyes
[03:24.856]absorbed private tears of loss.
[03:58.638]I am nothing as he was.
[04:03.473]I shared my thoughts with none.
[04:08.859]My memory carries only landscapes
[04:14.738]My endeavors shared with no one.
[04:57.438]The white cedar
[05:06.583]remembers
[05:15.653]a solitary figure
[05:25.878]lost in the fog.
[05:34.407]Hallowed
[05:40.057]The land I tread.
[05:45.628]Hollowed
[05:51.247]The life I lived.
[05:57.194]Haunted
[06:02.295]The heart in my chest
[06:08.247]Haunted…
[06:51.341]So none will mourn me,
[06:55.690]whether I'm delivered or damned.
[07:05.342]As I respire into finality
[07:10.846]none shall hold my hand
[07:19.440]No grieving tears
[07:21.612]staining wind burned cheeks
[07:25.890]No wails of sorrow
[07:29.504]echoing into the bleak.
[07:33.897]Just the memory of the white cedars
[07:40.085]standing in the mist.
